# What the machine measures (NeoPatchMachine.Readings, machine_readings): the output after Volume, in dBFS.
reading rms_db dB | The output's RMS over about half a second (-inf: silence)
reading peak_db dB | The output's peak, falling 20 dB a second (-inf: silence)
reading active_voices notes | Notes sounding now
reading nodes nodes | Nodes in the compiled patch (nodes that lead to no Out are not counted)
